T*
(* Syntax of Decision Structures: if condition: statement; elif alternative:) Tj
T*
(statement; else: fallback_statement.) Tj
T*
(* Truthiness and Falsy Values: In Python, conditions evaluate according to boolean) Tj
T*
(truthiness. The following evaluate to False: \(1\) None, \(2\) False, \(3\) Zero numeric) Tj
T*
(values \(0, 0.0, 0j\), \(4\) Empty sequence and collection containers \('', \(\), [], {},) Tj
T*
(set\(\)\), \(5\) Custom objects implementing __bool__\(\) returning False or __len__\(\)) Tj
T*
(returning 0. All other values evaluate to True.) Tj
T*
(* Conditional Ternary Expressions: Single-line conditional assignment: x = true_value) Tj
T*
(if condition else false_value.) Tj
T*
(* Structural Pattern Matching \(match-case, introduced in Python 3.10\): Provides) Tj
T*
(expressive pattern decomposition and guard filtering similar to switch-case) Tj
T*
(statements in C.) Tj
