(* The While Loop: Executes a code block repeatedly as long as a test condition) Tj
T*
(remains truthy: while condition: body.) Tj
T*
(- Infinite Loops: Caused by failing to update loop control variables inside the body) Tj
T*
(\(while True:\).) Tj
T*
(* The For Loop: Python's for loop is an iterator-driven 'for-each' construct that) Tj
T*
(traverses items in any iterable object \(list, tuple, string, dictionary, generator\):) Tj
T*
(for item in iterable: body.) Tj
T*
