(Problem Context: Implement a program generating the first N terms of the Fibonacci) Tj
T*
(sequence using a while loop and simultaneous variable assignment.) Tj
T*
(Python Source Code:) Tj
T*
(def generate_fibonacci\(n\):) Tj
T*
(if n <= 0:) Tj
T*
(return []) Tj
T*
(fib = []) Tj
T*
(a, b = 0, 1) Tj
T*
(count = 0) Tj
T*
(while count < n:) Tj
T*
(fib.append\(a\)) Tj
T*
(a, b = b, a + b  # Simultaneous tuple unpacking) Tj
T*
(count += 1) Tj
T*
(return fib) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(terms = 10) Tj
T*
(fib_series = generate_fibonacci\(terms\)) Tj
T*
(print\(f'First {terms} Fibonacci numbers: {fib_series}'\)) Tj
T*
